WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:10.490
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka de

00:00.350 --> 00:10.490
Under the moon’s curse, inside of a cold dream…

00:18.990 --> 00:25.380
Kotoba no nai sekai de bokura wa ai wo kataru

00:18.990 --> 00:25.380
In a world without words, we speak of love

00:25.380 --> 00:29.340
itsuka kimi ni todoku made

00:25.380 --> 00:29.340
until it reaches you someday.

00:32.170 --> 00:39.060
Kizu darake no kaina de dakiyoseta kuchibiru no

00:32.170 --> 00:39.060
I want to melt the frozen over wish...

00:39.060 --> 00:44.730
haritsumeta negai tokashitakute

00:39.060 --> 00:44.730
from the lips that I embraced with arms covered in wounds.

00:44.980 --> 00:51.690
Nee, aishiatta kako no utsukushisa sutesareba

00:44.980 --> 00:51.690
Hey, if I abandon the beauty of the past when we loved each other,

00:52.070 --> 00:57.870
ashita motto kirei na yoru e yukeru kara

00:52.070 --> 00:57.870
then tomorrow, I can go to a more beautiful night.

00:58.240 --> 01:06.420
Tsuki no kaasu tsumetai yume no naka kara

00:58.240 --> 01:06.420
Under the moon’s curse, from inside of a cold dream.

01:06.420 --> 01:13.090
Kimi wo tooku tsuresaritakute

01:06.420 --> 01:13.090
I want to take you somewhere far away,

01:13.090 --> 01:16.510
doko made yukeru

01:13.090 --> 01:16.510
and go anywhere,

01:16.510 --> 01:24.100
ai wo shinjite ii basho made

01:16.510 --> 01:24.100
to a place where we can believe in love.

01:32.200 --> 01:35.250
Zero doesn't have a sense of pain.

01:38.910 --> 01:43.880
Zero is Teacher Nagisa's creation,
the man-made painless series.

01:43.880 --> 01:47.790
Because they don't feel pain,
they'll take extreme measures in a fight.

01:49.090 --> 01:51.270
You can endure it.

01:51.780 --> 01:53.350
Clench you teeth.

01:59.510 --> 02:04.640
Fight to protect your Sacrifice.

02:05.810 --> 02:07.040
How beautiful...

02:08.360 --> 02:09.940
What a beautiful image...

02:31.330 --> 02:32.450
Soubi!

02:41.520 --> 02:42.510
Soubi...

02:49.020 --> 02:51.570
You can't fight by yourself anymore.

02:52.070 --> 02:53.940
Call Ritsuka Aoyagi.

03:03.370 --> 03:05.120
It's from Loveless, right?

03:05.120 --> 03:06.330
You can answer it.

03:10.420 --> 03:14.480
You will be connected to the voicemail account. Please wait a moment.

03:17.510 --> 03:21.840
You told me you'd always answer...

03:26.180 --> 03:29.270
What was that about? We gave you a chance.

03:30.230 --> 03:33.190
It's not necessary to have
a Sacrifice to fight you.

03:33.190 --> 03:36.110
Whoa! You said something annoying again!

03:36.340 --> 03:38.750
I know you're really hurting.

03:40.410 --> 03:42.990
I want to know a more piercing pain.

03:42.990 --> 03:46.060
You like pain?

03:46.060 --> 03:48.690
Ew, weirdo!

03:50.230 --> 03:52.190
Don't say something like
what Ritsuka would say...

03:52.820 --> 03:54.920
I might think you're cute if
I wasn't paying attention.

03:55.160 --> 03:56.420
Explode!

03:58.590 --> 04:02.340
I'll make more red flowers
bloom, right over your skin!

04:05.010 --> 04:06.010
Cold...

04:06.010 --> 04:09.710
Rather than pain, it feels
like piercing nails of ice...

04:10.560 --> 04:11.430
Freezing wind...

04:11.960 --> 04:13.270
...below freezing particles...

04:13.900 --> 04:15.650
Cover everything with snow and ice.

04:25.910 --> 04:27.080
What is this?

04:27.080 --> 04:28.370
Pretty!

04:28.370 --> 04:31.040
I'm reluctant to be saved by him.

04:31.450 --> 04:32.580
What are you saying?

04:34.170 --> 04:35.000
Zero...

04:35.670 --> 04:40.710
A characteristic of having the functions
of your peripheral nerves suspended...

04:43.220 --> 04:46.680
...is losing a considerable level
of your ability to sense.

04:47.600 --> 04:51.990
I don't know where you heard that,
but I'm impressed you know it.

04:54.150 --> 04:56.180
But... we do have a sense of touch.

04:56.530 --> 04:58.400
Don't you get it?

04:58.400 --> 05:01.710
Of course you guys don't get it.

05:02.160 --> 05:04.200
Just like you don't know this pain...

05:07.620 --> 05:08.780
Shatter!

05:11.620 --> 05:15.350
I don't want to know,
and don't need to know.

05:16.710 --> 05:21.630
But I like to imagine
how painful it might be.

05:23.340 --> 05:24.470
That's it...

05:25.180 --> 05:27.680
I love watching those expressions.

05:30.560 --> 05:33.270
I know it really hurts.

05:33.610 --> 05:36.730
Come on, why don't you hurry
up and call your sacrifice?

05:37.360 --> 05:39.360
It won't reach even if I call him.

05:41.760 --> 05:42.780
Why not?

05:43.990 --> 05:47.740
Because we're not linked yet.

06:02.220 --> 06:03.690
Really!

06:03.690 --> 06:05.470
How lame.

06:07.010 --> 06:09.050
It's no use waiting for him, then.

06:11.640 --> 06:12.930
Do you know what this is?

06:15.000 --> 06:16.850
It's a nail!

06:22.650 --> 06:23.520
Ritsuka...

06:36.710 --> 06:40.510
Wow, blood is pretty warm.

06:40.510 --> 06:42.250
It's overflowing.

06:42.610 --> 06:44.330
Hey, does it hurt?

06:44.330 --> 06:45.340
Does it hurt?

06:45.340 --> 06:47.470
Isn't it painful? You
can't do it alone, can you?

06:50.850 --> 06:53.420
Why are you doing this?

06:53.420 --> 06:55.470
Because it's fun, of course.

06:55.470 --> 06:58.190
This method isn't right...

06:58.770 --> 07:00.180
Use your spells!

07:01.360 --> 07:03.650
Have you lost your mind from the pain?

07:03.650 --> 07:05.690
You're the one who escaped death.

07:06.450 --> 07:08.650
This is against the rules.

07:08.650 --> 07:10.120
Shut up!

07:10.120 --> 07:11.820
We just need to win!

07:11.820 --> 07:12.510
Wrong.

07:14.460 --> 07:15.740
In a battle...

07:15.740 --> 07:18.020
...aesthetics are necessary.

07:18.630 --> 07:22.670
It's impossible for those
who know pain to lose against...

07:23.080 --> 07:24.630
...those who don't.

07:25.420 --> 07:27.340
Shut up! What is this, a lecture?

07:27.740 --> 07:31.260
If you want it that badly,
I'll give you another one!

07:38.860 --> 07:40.960
W-What the...

07:40.960 --> 07:42.370
My body...

07:45.900 --> 07:48.580
I-I don't have the strength!

07:48.580 --> 07:50.360
What did you do?

07:52.100 --> 07:57.160
The Zero's fatal weakness is the inability to
expand or contract their capillaries.

07:57.700 --> 07:59.580
You'll freeze to death like that.

08:00.540 --> 08:05.380
A Zero doesn't sweat, doesn't get
goosebumps...

08:06.590 --> 08:12.800
That's because they can't protect
themselves from temperature changes.

08:15.940 --> 08:18.080
I always wanted to forget...

08:18.900 --> 08:21.850
...those days, your words...

08:22.100 --> 08:24.600
Fight, Soubi...

08:25.360 --> 08:28.400
...and no matter the case, win.

08:29.700 --> 08:32.950
Wind of absolute zero! Rob all heat!

08:49.590 --> 08:50.800
I win.

09:04.610 --> 09:05.690
Teacher...

09:07.900 --> 09:09.790
Teacher, wake up.

09:10.280 --> 09:12.290
What a lovely voice...

09:12.740 --> 09:14.590
Let me stay like this
for a while longer...

09:16.580 --> 09:18.400
What an unreasonable woman.

09:24.710 --> 09:25.790
Finally you're awake.

09:26.650 --> 09:28.350
Oh, Agatsuma...

09:28.760 --> 09:31.270
It's dark. You better go home.

09:37.260 --> 09:40.850
U-Um, I'm sorry I...

09:41.440 --> 09:42.770
Agatsuma!

09:43.140 --> 09:44.810
What is this wound?!

09:44.810 --> 09:46.060
I don't believe this.

09:46.450 --> 09:48.160
Let's hurry to a hospital!

09:48.160 --> 09:51.190
An ambulance, we need to call an ambulance!!

09:51.610 --> 09:53.370
It's fine, leave it alone.

09:55.950 --> 09:57.680
It's my fault... isn't it.

09:57.980 --> 09:58.860
Huh?

09:59.450 --> 10:02.870
You got injured trying to save me...

10:02.870 --> 10:04.060
Don't flatter yourself.

10:04.750 --> 10:08.370
Why would I endure all this pain for you?

10:11.630 --> 10:14.170
We live in different worlds.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.100
Liar!

10:17.970 --> 10:22.740
I don't understand what
you're trying to say...

10:24.560 --> 10:26.100
Don't you understand Japanese?

10:27.440 --> 10:29.990
I'm saying it's none of your business!

10:33.490 --> 10:35.610
Why do you have to say it like that?

10:36.080 --> 10:39.170
You always say it the
worst way possible.

10:40.240 --> 10:42.580
It's true that you saved me...

10:43.000 --> 10:44.430
You're so warped!

10:44.830 --> 10:49.750
Acting like that, you won't
have any friends left!

10:56.130 --> 10:59.890
A teacher like you would
never be able to imagine...

11:04.770 --> 11:07.350
I just need one person.

11:09.810 --> 11:13.730
One person to totally control me.

11:15.200 --> 11:18.110
That is my wish...

11:26.340 --> 11:27.940
Agatsuma...

11:51.730 --> 11:52.750
Ritsuka...

12:04.580 --> 12:06.200
Ritsuka, you're still a kid...

12:09.750 --> 12:12.040
I want to be dominated by you...

12:20.590 --> 12:21.920
Soubi!

12:32.110 --> 12:32.770
Don't come!

12:34.610 --> 12:35.850
What's wrong?

12:37.860 --> 12:39.360
Nothing.

12:39.860 --> 12:40.780
What about you, Ritsuka?

12:41.870 --> 12:43.250
What are you doing here?

12:43.780 --> 12:46.710
Where were you until now?

12:47.080 --> 12:48.990
I couldn't even reach
you on your cell phone...

12:53.500 --> 12:55.040
I looked for you.

12:56.130 --> 12:56.960
Sorry...

12:57.800 --> 13:00.960
But really, it's nothing.

13:01.760 --> 13:03.800
You're lying to me again.

13:09.380 --> 13:11.560
Don't touch me...

13:11.980 --> 13:13.350
You'll get dirty.

13:13.690 --> 13:15.100
What are you talking about!

13:15.100 --> 13:16.940
What do you mean, don't touch?

13:17.310 --> 13:20.350
You don't answer your phone!
You don't tell the truth!

13:20.820 --> 13:22.780
You always tease...

13:23.320 --> 13:25.740
Am I your pet? A girlfriend?

13:27.080 --> 13:30.320
You're my Sacrifice.

13:32.170 --> 13:35.970
I was worried the whole time.

13:39.330 --> 13:40.260
Sorry.

13:47.850 --> 13:49.800
Good night, Ritsuka...

13:49.820 --> 13:50.810
Soubi!

14:01.030 --> 14:01.610
Blood...

14:02.270 --> 14:03.190
Soubi's?

14:09.620 --> 14:10.840
What is he doing?

14:11.960 --> 14:12.580
Idiot!

14:27.220 --> 14:30.310
I know, Seimei...

14:40.230 --> 14:41.840
Good morning, Ritsuka.

14:44.400 --> 14:45.570
Morning...

14:45.570 --> 14:49.910
Look, look, I found
these on my way to school.

14:50.290 --> 14:51.320
See?

14:52.040 --> 14:54.280
I gave one to our teacher, too.

14:54.280 --> 14:56.240
Which one do you want?

14:56.940 --> 14:58.040
Acorns?

14:58.750 --> 15:00.490
Well, it is kinda rural around here...

15:00.490 --> 15:02.230
This is still Tokyo.

15:03.170 --> 15:04.670
Oh, right, sorry...

15:09.720 --> 15:11.950
Did you have a fight with Soubi?

15:12.910 --> 15:14.750
W-Why?

15:14.750 --> 15:18.070
Well, you look down.

15:21.070 --> 15:22.190
Don't touch me!

15:22.940 --> 15:26.720
You're abnormally keen sometimes...

15:27.370 --> 15:28.330
Huh? Huh?

15:31.120 --> 15:32.200
Ritsuka?

15:32.590 --> 15:34.700
Can I have one too?

15:34.890 --> 15:36.150
Acorns...

15:36.150 --> 15:37.230
For you!

15:37.230 --> 15:38.200
Y-Yuiko...

15:38.200 --> 15:39.840
Sorry, Ritsuka.

15:39.840 --> 15:42.000
Did I say something wrong?

15:42.000 --> 15:43.420
Yuiko...

15:44.500 --> 15:48.310
Acorns, tumbling down, acorns...

15:49.340 --> 15:52.130
...tumbling down...

15:53.970 --> 15:57.510
This is my first time,
even though I'm already 23.

16:02.070 --> 16:02.900
Quiet!

16:03.850 --> 16:05.770
Please be quiet.

16:06.610 --> 16:09.400
We'd like to decide on what to
do for the school arts festival.

16:09.400 --> 16:11.070
What a pain!

16:11.070 --> 16:12.240
Whatever.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.360
Be serious!

16:14.020 --> 16:15.410
Teacher!

16:16.830 --> 16:18.630
Please do something.

16:18.630 --> 16:20.950
We can't discuss anything like this...

16:21.860 --> 16:23.040
You're right.

16:23.040 --> 16:27.230
Okay everybody, this
is about you guys, okay?

16:29.300 --> 16:30.300
Hey!

16:30.800 --> 16:33.300
You know it's against the rules
to bring games to school.

16:33.510 --> 16:34.720
Oh, come on!

16:34.720 --> 16:36.930
Give it to me, I'm confiscating it.

16:36.930 --> 16:38.060
No way!

16:38.060 --> 16:39.390
Hey, wait!

16:40.310 --> 16:43.310
Leave me alone, it's
none of your business!

16:46.650 --> 16:47.520
Why...

16:48.700 --> 16:51.570
Why do you say that?

16:52.320 --> 16:53.780
It's none of your business.

17:05.050 --> 17:06.830
Are you okay, teacher?

17:10.430 --> 17:12.820
Yes. Sorry about that...

17:14.220 --> 17:15.840
Well, then good...

17:17.720 --> 17:18.930
Hey, Aoyagi...

17:20.730 --> 17:21.370
Yes?

17:22.400 --> 17:25.150
Give this back to Agatsuma.

17:28.820 --> 17:30.390
This is Soubi's!

17:31.320 --> 17:33.540
Did you hear anything about the injury?

17:33.540 --> 17:34.080
What?

17:35.510 --> 17:39.120
Sorry, it's probably my fault.

17:39.640 --> 17:43.500
He defended me from being hassled
and it seems he got badly hurt.

17:44.920 --> 17:49.010
I want to apologize, but it
looks like he doesn't like me, so...

17:49.880 --> 17:52.050
So he was hurt...

17:53.050 --> 17:54.340
You'll get dirty.

17:54.730 --> 17:56.680
It's nothing.

17:59.680 --> 18:01.850
Stupid!

18:01.850 --> 18:03.550
Why didn't he tell me?

18:17.410 --> 18:20.000
I went a little too far...

18:30.460 --> 18:32.660
Ritsuka will be mad at me again...

18:37.890 --> 18:39.340
I'm sorry about today.

18:40.100 --> 18:43.420
I'm sorry too, for crying.

18:43.420 --> 18:46.150
But don't bring games.

18:46.150 --> 18:47.800
None of your business!

18:47.800 --> 18:48.310
Hey!

18:48.940 --> 18:50.340
See ya!

18:59.990 --> 19:02.490
Hey, isn't Ritsuka acting strange today?

19:02.920 --> 19:04.180
Really?

19:04.180 --> 19:08.210
He was really down this
morning, but now he's mad.

19:09.000 --> 19:11.390
Maybe it's really because of Soubi?

19:13.210 --> 19:14.540
Ritsuka?

19:14.540 --> 19:16.820
Sorry! I'm gonna go home.

19:16.820 --> 19:17.550
Ritsuka!

19:20.470 --> 19:24.450
Y-Yuiko, let's go home together!

19:24.450 --> 19:25.430
Aww...

19:26.100 --> 19:28.310
Yuiko...

19:41.370 --> 19:42.740
Hey, Kio...

19:44.180 --> 19:45.660
Are you really coming to my place?

19:46.420 --> 19:49.410
Why do you think I bought these?

19:49.920 --> 19:52.810
In any case, what are you
gonna do with that injury?

19:52.810 --> 19:54.710
Well, but...

19:54.710 --> 19:58.180
Don't worry, just leave it to me.

19:59.340 --> 20:01.880
Anything, from changing clothes
to giving you a sponge bath...

20:01.880 --> 20:03.550
Did you say something?

20:03.550 --> 20:05.200
Nothing.

20:06.440 --> 20:07.820
Don't worry about it.

20:13.360 --> 20:14.350
Soubi!

20:14.800 --> 20:19.400
Don't tell me, you're going
down the path of a criminal!

20:20.910 --> 20:22.110
Come on...

20:23.370 --> 20:27.280
They don't have anywhere else to
go, so I'm letting them stay here.

20:28.420 --> 20:29.080
And besides...

20:30.670 --> 20:35.430
...these are directions from Seimei,
see everything through to completion.

20:35.880 --> 20:39.170
I see, Seimei, then Ritsuka,
and next, kids.

20:40.040 --> 20:42.000
What a big heart you have...

20:42.350 --> 20:43.520
Who are you?

20:44.590 --> 20:45.840
Who are you calling "you"?!

20:45.840 --> 20:47.680
You mouthy brat.

20:47.890 --> 20:49.600
I was referring to <i>you</i>.

20:49.600 --> 20:51.750
You're still saying
that with a cute face!

20:51.750 --> 20:53.640
I was born cute.

20:53.640 --> 20:56.000
I was cute when I was a kid too!

21:01.320 --> 21:07.320
I command you
not to lie to me anymore from now on.

21:01.320 --> 21:07.320
Not telling me the truth
also counts as a lie.

21:08.530 --> 21:10.560
Lecture by mail, huh...

21:11.500 --> 21:13.490
Well done, Ritsuka.

21:29.100 --> 21:29.680
Or...

21:29.680 --> 21:34.600
To be continued...

21:31.350 --> 21:40.900
Setsunasa no kagiri made dakishimete mo

21:31.430 --> 21:40.980
Even if I hold you with all my suffering,

21:41.780 --> 21:51.280
itsu made mo hitotsu ni wa narenakute

21:41.780 --> 21:51.280
we still can't be one.

21:51.870 --> 22:01.800
Yasashisa yori fukai basho de fureau no wa itami dake

21:51.870 --> 22:01.800
The only thing that we can feel deep within besides kindness is pain,

22:02.210 --> 22:09.800
futari wo musunde kudasai

22:02.210 --> 22:09.800
so please, bind the two of us together.

22:12.350 --> 22:17.190
Bokura wa mou yume wo minai

22:12.350 --> 22:17.190
We no longer dream anymore,

22:17.190 --> 22:22.320
tomadoinagara te wo totte

22:17.190 --> 22:22.320
when you're wavering, take my hand

22:22.610 --> 22:31.530
zankoku na yoake no hou e arukidasu

22:22.610 --> 22:31.530
as we tread towards the cruel light of dawn.

22:32.660 --> 22:42.670
Hontou no kotoba wa kitto hontou no sekai no dokoka

22:32.660 --> 22:42.670
I'm sure real words are somewhere in the real world.

22:43.000 --> 22:51.890
Bokura no mukuchi na yoru ni hisonderu

22:43.000 --> 22:51.890
They lurk in the shadows of our silent nights.

22:52.260 --> 22:57.390
Ima mo kitto

22:52.260 --> 22:57.390
Surely, even now...

23:01.070 --> 23:05.030
A gentle person can be very sensitive...

23:05.450 --> 23:06.900
...and can detect something with no evidence.

23:07.290 --> 23:09.750
Did something happen
between you and Soubi?

23:09.750 --> 23:10.740
Are you okay?

23:10.740 --> 23:14.000
Sorry, Yuiko, I thought you were stupid.

23:14.000 --> 23:14.940
What?

23:14.940 --> 23:16.970
But you're not stupid at all.

23:16.970 --> 23:17.870
Ritsuka...

23:18.580 --> 23:20.580
Tale eight, Trustless.

23:21.330 --> 23:22.760
Then, let's exchange diaries!

23:22.760 --> 23:23.840
I'll pass.
